      "role": "user",
      "content": "everything just feels so quiet now. like i walk through my apartment and it doesnt even feel like mine anymore. i look in the mirror and i dont even recognize the person looking back. its like ten years of my life just... evaporated. i dont even know who i am without them. i just feel like a ghost.",
